# Dev Dependency Versions
RULE: Use codex-standard dev deps: pytest>=9.0.1, pytest-cov>=7.0.0, ruff==0.15.0, basedpyright>=1.20.0.
WHY: Consistent test behavior, plugin compatibility, quality gate alignment across 30+ repos.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/dependency-management.md, .cursor/rules/dependency-version-alignment.mdc
DO: Check codex before adding; use exact ruff pin; basedpyright not pyright
NEVER: Mix pytest 8.x and 9.x; use pyright; skip ruff exact pin
